<title>USA: Vector Aeromotive in merger talks.</title>
<headline>Vector Aeromotive in merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Aeromotive Corp said it is in preliminary talks with Tradelink International Ltd, under which Tradelink would acquire a controlling interest in Vector.</p>
<p>Vector suspended its automotive manufacturing operations on November 9, and since then has been attempting to secure new financing that would allow it to recommence operations.</p>
<p>No terms of any possible transaction have yet been agreed upon.</p>
</text>
